      "solution": "import torch\nfrom torch import nn\n\n\ndef trace_shapes(h):\n    x = torch.zeros(1, 1, h, h)\n    pool = nn.MaxPool2d(2)\n    x = pool(torch.relu(nn.Conv2d(1, 4, 3, padding=1)(x)))\n    first = list(x.shape)\n    x = pool(torch.relu(nn.Conv2d(4, 8, 3)(x)))\n    return [first, list(x.shape), list(x.flatten(1).shape)]\n",
